[43.028071,"o","\u001b[0m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Bind the existing BGP peer\r\n  ==========================\r\n\r\n  A profile alone protects no session. This section opts the existing\r\n  frr BGP peer into single-hop BFD and selects the fast profile.\r\n\r\n  FRR: neighbor 172.29.0.1 bfd profile fast\r\n  Ze:  bgp peer frr connection bfd { enabled true; profile fast; }\r\n\r\n  The live binding must not replace Ze or reconnect an established BGP\r\n  session merely to enable BFD.\r\n"]
