[109.904215,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Cut the path and inspect the cause\r\n  ==================================\r\n\r\n  Bring frr0 down, leaving the shown Ze process alive.\r\n\r\n  The readiness check requires the BFD Up-to-Down transition with\r\n  control-detection-time-expired and a BGP Cease / BFD Down notification\r\n  (code 6, subcode 10), before the negotiated hold timer expires.\r\n\r\n  The next commands show the retained BFD transition and BGP history.\r\n"]
